{"smgs(usa)" "The Armoured rifle squad is a 12-man squad armed with 11 M1 Garands, one M1 Garand with M7 Grenade launcher and a Thompson. Soldiers are skill 3 except the SL which is skill 4."}
{"riflemans(usa)" "The Rifle Squad is a 12-man squad armed with 8 M1 Garands, 1 B.A.R, one M1 Garand with M7 Grenade launcher, 1 Thompson and 1 Bazooka. Soldiers are skill 3 except the SL which is skill 4."}
{"elites(usa)" "The Airborne squad is a 12-man squad armed with 4 M1 Garands, 3 M1A1 Carbines, 1 B.A.R, 1 .30 cal M1919 A6, 1 M1903A4 sniper, one M1 Garand with M7 Grenade launcher and a Thompson. Soldiers are skill 5 except the SL which is skill 6."}
{"stormtroopers(usa)" "The Ranger squad is a 12-man squad armed with 4 M1 Garands, 2 M1093 Springfield Rifles, 2 M1 Carbines, 2 B.A.Rs, 1 M9A1 Bazooka and one M1 Garand with M7 Grenade launcher. Soldiers are skill 6."}
{"bazookers(usa)" "This team of anti-tank rocket-launcher infantrymen is armed with a Bazooka and they are trained to destroy tanks in close combat using armor-piercing rockets. They are capable of destroying even the heaviest armored vehicles -- provided they can find a weakness to exploit and they do not miss. Beware of the armored skirts on some vehicles, as they greatly reduce the effectiveness of these shaped-charge rounds."}
