{"officers(usa)" "This experienced field officer is capable of supporting your troops by spotting enemy units from afar with his binoculars. Use his skill in locating enemy units through the fog of war, so that your other units can engage or avoid them as necessary. The officer also reduces your current CP by 20 which allows you to field a bigger army."}
